e4fd45e9b331d947129f9d33255.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 80977](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8914/Sample%20Apartment/4c58371d63050fcec0060677c5b3988a.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Location of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 80978](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8914/Location/75da82b9ac0d1b783ca07a08ec62636e.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n## Project Overview of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n329 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.78 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 24 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nWelcome to Kalpavruksh Heights, a luxurious residential project by Sethia Infrastructure located in the vibrant locale of Link Road, Kandivali. Named after the divine Kalpavruksh tree, symbolizing fulfillment of desires, this promises a lifestyle of unparalleled luxury and comfort.  \n  \nKalpavruksh Heights stands tall as a high-rise tower amidst a spacious landscape, offering residents a serene escape from the bustling city life. With meticulously designed 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 2.5 BHK apartments, each unit reflects opulence and sophistication, catering to the discerning tastes of modern homeowners.  \n  \nSituated in a buzzing neighborhood, residents can enjoy seamless connectivity to various amenities and facilities, ensuring convenience at every step. Whether you seek a peaceful abode or a vibrant community to immerse yourself in, Kalpavruksh Heights is the epitome of a dream home where aspirations come to life.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 626213](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8914/BHK_Configuration/7673f5d2572ab79601d95005734da26b.webp)\n\n1 BHK Flat\n\n