sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Kandivali West](/location-review/mumbai/kandivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Kandivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Kandivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nSethia Kalpavruksh Heights is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800008716](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800008716)\n\nProject: Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights Kandivali West\n\n---\n\n* Nirmal Junior College\n* Shri T.P. Bhatia College of Science\n* Balbharti College Of Commerce\n* KES Shroff college\n\n* BMC HospitaI\n* Saraswati Hospital\n* Paarth Hospital\n* Namaha Hospital\n\n* Infinity 2 Mall\n* Thakur Mall\n* V Mall\n* Reliance Digital\n\n* Sainath Refreshment\n* Swadesi Dairy Products\n* Deepalis Only Veg\n* The Shawarma Fellow\n\n![Sethia Infrastructure](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/507_1678040173_untitled-fsedfsedf1.webp)\n\n## [Sethia Infrastructure](/mumbai/sale/builder/sethia-infrastructure-507)\n\nOngoing Projects: 5\n\nCompleted Projects: 11\n\nTotal Projects: 16\n\n---\n\nParadigmatic homes with reliability and affordability, Sethia Infrastructure flatters the competition and sets forth itself as a paramount company. Within 22 years of experience, they have created a wave of luxury lifestyles. They emerged with a portfolio of high-end residential units, desirable commercial and industrial spaces, and have also extended their expertise to the Hospitality sector.   \n  \nWith more developments, Sethia Infrastructure continues with the prospect of commitment to timely and desired delivery, customer-centricity, and affordability. Having a mindfulness goal of Two-way profits benefiting the customer besides the developer helped them grow tremendously. Testimony to their Quality engineering and professionalism are 11 completed and 4 ongoing projects. Sethia Grandeur, Centre Plaza, and Shukra are the results of the trust they have   \ncreated.  \n  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Sethia Infrastructure](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/sethia-infrastructure-507)\n\n## FAQ's about Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n\n### Explore Projects in Kandivali West\n\n* [New Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Pre Launch Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/possession/pre-launch)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/fl