roperties in Kandivali West](/buy/mumbai/kandivali-west-1a256b7a71)\n\n>\n\nSethia Infrastructure\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/sethia-infrastructure-sethia-kalpavruksh-heights-elevation-1684325351.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/sethia-infrastructure-sethia-kalpavruksh-heights-elevation-1684325449.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/sethia-infrastructure-sethia-kalpavruksh-heights-location-map-1684325427.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/sethia-infrastructure-sethia-kalpavruksh-heights-elevation-1684325351.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/sethia-infrastructure-sethia-kalpavruksh-heights-elevation-1684325449.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150722032344-NewProject-2022-07-15T151644093.png)\n\n# Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights\n\nKalpavruksh Heights Wing\\_d, Kalpavruksh Heights, New Link Rd, Kandivali, Irani Wadi, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067\n\nKandivali West\n\n₹89.46 L - 1.28 Cr\n\n₹89.46 L - 1.28 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\n\"Kalpavruksh Heights stands as a magnificent tower that houses luxurious homes, offering a lifestyle of opulence and grandeur. Every facet of this edifice exudes splendor and luxury, creating an ambiance of refinement and elegance. The tower is meticulously designed to cater to the modern needs and desires of its residents. Featuring spacious 1 BHK, 1.5 BHK, and 2 BHK residences, Kalpavruksh Heights ensures that residents enjoy ample privacy and comfort within their living spaces. The interiors are characterized by stylish design and intelligent layouts that optimize natural light and space, enhancing the overall living experience. This project offers exclusive residential units that elevate and enrich your lifestyle, providing you with the opportunity to lead the life you've always dreamt of. Kalpavruksh Heights promises to fulfill your aspirations, allowing you to experience the life you've always wished for in a home that reflects your dreams and desires.\"\n\n1 BHK, 1.5 BHK, 2 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2022\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹21,000/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n426 - 609 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Three open-side properties.\n* Convenient access to essential landmarks.\n* These units are thoughtfully designed as the perfect blend of comfort and style.\n\n* Featuring landscaped gardens, a tree plantation, and a children's play area to enhance comfortable living\n* Easily reachable schools, hospitals, educational institutes, restaurants, banks, and a cineplex.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nConnectivity\n\nThe project is strategically located near the New Link Road and is a short walk from the nearest metro station.\n\nConstruction Quality\n\nMost owners report that the internal build quality and flat designs are solid and visually appealing.\n\nAccess to Essentials\n\nDaily necessities, markets, and shopping malls like Infiniti are within easy walking distance.\n\nSecurity\n\nThe building features a well-decorated entrance lobby and maintains consistent security personnel.\n\nInternal Amenities\n\nResidents appreciate the inclusion of a fitness center, clubhouse, and terrace views.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nParking Crisis\n\nResidents report a major lack of adequate parking space for both owners and visitors, leading to frequent disputes.\n\nExternal Environment\n\nThe immediate neighborhood is described as dense and cluttered, with nearby chawls and dirty roads.\n\nEncroachment\n\nPedestrian movement is often restricted due to unauthorized parking and auto-rickshaws encroaching on the footpaths.\n\nUtility Issues\n\nSome reviews highlight inconsistent experiences with water supply and occasional power cuts.\n\nSpace Constraints\n\nThere is limited open space within the building premises for walking or recreational activities.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nExcellent for metro commuters\n\nGood value for mid-range budgets\n\nAvoid if you own multiple vehicles\n\nNot ideal for those seeking quiet surroundings\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/clinic-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/clinic-secondary.svg)\n\nHome Automation\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multipurpose-Hall-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multipurpose-Hall-secondary.svg)\n\nParty Lawn\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icon