\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nSethia Kalpavruksh Heights has 1 BHK, 1.5 BHK, 2 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium, Home Automation, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Party Lawn, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights is Sethia Infrastructure.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights:Sethia Infrastructure](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/150722032344-NewProject-2022-07-15T151644093.png)\n\n## Sethia Infrastructure\n\n\"Sethia Group is a prominent player in the private sector construction industry, commencing its construction activities in the early 2000s. The group's flagship company, Sethia Infrastructure, has been committed to delivering projects characterized by superior quality construction, aesthetic design, affordability, and punctual delivery since its inception. Sethia Infrastructure places a paramount focus on customer satisfaction, making it their primary mission. Over the years, they have earned the trust and respect of their customers, positioning themselves as one of the premier companies in the industry. The company has left a significant mark in various segments, including Residential, Commercial, Industrial, Slum Rehabilitation, Land Development, and Multiplex cinema.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projec