://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_kalpavruksh-heights-kandivali-west_2842.html)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21022.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21022.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21023.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21024.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21025.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21026.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21027.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21028.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights - Wing B Flr Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21029.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights - Wing C Flr Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21030.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights - Location Map](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21031.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights - Wing B Flr Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21029.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights - Wing C Flr Plan](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21030.jpeg)\n\n![Kalpavruksh Heights - Location Map](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/photo-21031.jpeg)\n\nby Sethia Infra\n\n# Kalpavruksh Heights\n\nCharkop Road, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 1 BHK, 1.5 BHK, 2 BHK & 2.5 BHK Apartments\n\nSize 401 Sq.ft To 742 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice ₹1.62 Cr Onwards\n\nCall Now +919820575619\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow2842\n\nPossession Status Possession Expected Around December 2020\n\nRERA P51800008716  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## KALPAVRUKSH HEIGHTS\n\n**Kalpavruksh Heights** is a amazing tower that consists of luxurious homes. A place where each nook and corner talks of elegance and lavishness, this building displays attractive functions and stylish outdoor settings. The tower is designed keeping in mind modern day wants and demands. The rooms are large providing sufficient privacy\n\nto the people. Decorations are stylish and smartly developed to maximize lighting and area. It provides you with unique housing spaces which will improve and enlighten your life-style. Lead a lifestyle of your wishes and knowledge a life of your dreams you always desired for, at Kalpavruksh Heights.  \n  \nKalpavruksh Heights is a on-going housing project placed at Jawaharlal Ramsumer Yadav Marg, Irani Wadi, Kandiwali West, Mumbai. This project involve in 0.78 Acre Project Land , 4 Towers and 276 Units  of 24 Floors. Kalpavruksh Heights provide device of Studio, 1 BHK, 1.5 BHK, 2 BHK & 2.5 BHK with starting area from 401 Sq.ft To 742 Sq.ft Carpet Area world class facilities and top line features.  \n  \nFounded in 2000, with a firm view of offering value for money options in real estate, the **Sethia Group** today is a multiple-faceted entity with projects that period the range of the industry verticals, ranging from development of housing, industrial. The Sethia Group has a strong existence in the Western Suburbs of Mumbai with more than 5 mil square feet of ongoing and planned growth to their credit and a happy customer base of more than 5,000 happy family members.  \n  \nThis specific project is presently at a under development stage and the structure work is predicted to be commenced very soon. Contact us for more details like reservation, accessibility, cost etc.\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 401 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 1.62 CR |\n| 1 BHK | 423 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 1.71 CR |\n| 1.5 BHK | 558 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 2.25 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 580 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 2.34 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 655 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 2.64 CR |\n| 2.5 BHK | 708 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 2.85 CR |\n| 2.5 BHK | 742 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 2.99 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n**Community Amenities :**  \n\\* Garden   \n\\* 24Hr Backup   \n\\* Club House   \n\\* Community Hall  \n  \n**Kid Friendly :**  \n\\* Play Area  \n  \n**Connectivity :**  \n\\* Intercom  \n  \n**Green Living :**  \n\\* Rain Water Harvesting  \n  \n**Health & Fitness :**  \n\\* Gymnasium Indoor Games\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n**Entrance Lobby**  \n\\* At Kalpavruksh Heights, we have well decorated entrance lobby with 24 hour CCTV surveillance in common lobby areas.  \n  \n**Living Room**  \n\\* Decorative gate door with quality fitting & safety lock  \n\\* Video Door phone in Living room  \n\\* Granite sill frame to all windows  \n\\* Anodized aluminum sliding windows with Mosquito Net  \n  \n**Kitchen**  \n\\* Granite kitchen platform and service platform with SS sink and drainboard  \n\\* Vitrified flooring and Designer dado tiles up to lintal level  \n  \n**Master Bedroom**  \n\\* Designer flush doors in all Bedrooms  \n\\* Wooden Flooring in Master Bedroom  \n\\* Air Conditioner in Master Bedroom  \n  \n**Bathroom**  \n\\* Designer dado tiles upto lintal level  \n\\* Concealed plumbing with exclusive fittings & fixtures  \n\\* Instant geyser in master toilet  \n\\* Counter top basin in master toilet\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/2842/qra_2011.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800008716\n\n**Developer:** Sethia Infra\n\n**Project:** Kalpavruksh Heights\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Charkop Road, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Charkop Road, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Jawharlala Yadaw Marg, Link Road & Mahatma Nagar\n\nFAQ\n\n#