yexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-elevation-image-1.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-elevation-image-2.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-elevation-image-3.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-amenities.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-multipurpose-hall.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-living-room.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-masterbed.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-kitchen.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-bathroom.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-location.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-ground-floor-layout.webp)![Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9797/9797-oth-kalpavruksh-heights-wing-a-typical-floor-plan.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\n## Kalpavruksh Heights, Kandivali West, Mumbai Wali Life & Outskirts Wala Price.\n\nAptly named as **Kalpavruksh**, a **Godly tree that fulfills all your desires**, Kalpavruksh Heights is an answer to your search for a dream home and once you come here all your other dreams and desires will also come true.A high rise tower sprawled across a spacious arena, is your change to escape to a fine living. The flats are designed to reflect grandeur and luxurious living. Kalpavruksh Heights has 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 2.5 BHK apartments.\n\n**Key Details of Kalpavruksh Heights:**\n\n* 23 Storeys Structure, located Near Laljipada Police Chowkly, Link Road, **Kandivali West** and is developed by **Sethia Infrastructure.**\n* **Kalpavruksh Heights was launched in May 2014 and the possession of the same is likely to be in Dec 2020.**\n* **Kalpavruksh Heights is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing P51800008716.**\n* Grand Entrance Lobby & 24x7 Security.\n* Air Condition in Master Bedroom\n* An Architecture so strong, is the greatest advantage.\n* **Kalpavruksh Heights has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 3.5 out of 5.**\n\nSethia Infrastructure also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Sethia Green View, Sethia Sea View, Sethia Link View, Kalpavruksh Heights, Sethia Grandeur, Sethia Imperial Avenue, Sethia Sea View .   \n  \n**The property prices in Kandivali West** are in the range of 13000 to 17500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects.  \n  \n Sethia Infrastructure currently has 3 Under Construction projects.\n\n**You can download the brochure of Kalpavruksh Heights** and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website.The Bookings for the Under Construction project Kalpavruksh Heights are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience. Kalpavruksh Heights is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nJun 2021\n\nRevised\n\nJun 2021\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\