Mumbai](https://www.addressofchoice.com/sethia-infrastructure-in-mumbai-cdp6929i1)\n/* [Kandivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-kandivali-west-mumbai-l1458) \n  + [Properties For Sale In Kandivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-kandivali-west-mumbai-l1458)\n  + [Apartments Flats Sale In Kandivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/kandivali-west/apartments-lpt5l1458)\n  + [House/Villas for sale in Kandivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/kandivali-west/villas-lpt7l1458)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Kandivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/kandivali-west/ready-to-move-lps4l1458)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Kandivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/kandivali-west/plots-lpt6l1458)\n/* Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights\n\n## Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Kandivali West](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-kandivali-west-mumbai-l1458) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Sethia Infrastructure](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-sethia-infrastructure-d6929)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Link Rd, Kandivali, Irani Wadi, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 1.74 Cr to 3.07 Cr\\*\n\n# Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights in Kandivali West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/59233/1624537749_e1.jpg \"Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 666 sqft - 1175 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 334 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: 78 Acres\n* Possession: June, 2021\n* Rera: P51800008716\n\n## About\n\nSethia Kalpavruksh Heights is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Kandivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 78 Acres, the project features 334 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 666 sqft to 1175 sqft. The address for the project is link rd, kandivali, irani wadi, kandivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400067..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 666 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 1175 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 1.74 Cr and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 3.07 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Sethia Infrastructure, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800008716 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2021-06-15, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nSethia Kalpavruksh Heights is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden. The security features include CCTV for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: 78 Acres\n* Units & Towers: 334 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 666 sqft to 1175 sqft\n* Project Address: link rd, kandivali, irani wadi, kandivali west, mumbai, maharashtra 400067.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Sethia Infrastructure\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800008716 Units\n* Possession Start: 2021-06-15\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: CCTV\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nSethia Kalpavruksh Heights benefits from its location in Kandivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights will begin in 2021-06-15, and the project is RERA registered under P51800008716 Units. Developed by Sethia Infrastructure, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![CCTV](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528887020_cctv.svg) CCTV\n\n## Floor Plans of Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights\n\n![Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/floorplan/59233/1624537655_1bhk1.jpg \"Sethia Kalpavruksh Heights Floor Plan 666 sqft\")\n\n1 BHK (666 Sq. Ft.)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 1.39 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore renta